Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the courage\Nthat sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NVillager\NZenef
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the conscious points our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there, no regrets!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Gordingus\NGriff\NLil T\NPollychan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}DemonRin\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.69,0:01:52.99,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(523,0)\t(482,523,\1a&H00&)}Conis
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.69,0:01:52.99,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(523,0)}Conis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to bring it along?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:01:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.23,0:02:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't think I'll need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not certain you'll be\Nable to use it where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just really like this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mourn them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to put on\Nsuch a formal act, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Express yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but don't make the same\Nmistakes as those fools
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who couldn't comprehend\Nthe true power of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took me too lightly and so\Nforfeited their lives in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their failure was that their\Nminds were not controlled by fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so they were not\Nprepared for battle with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I-I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him on to my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to\Nobey everything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.03,0:03:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An opportunity for escape will\Npresent itself at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for you to be skeptical
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the only ship of\Nits kind in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it can only be controlled by me in other\Nwords it's powered purely by lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible i assure you\Nit is possible i channel my abundant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy through material that Can handle\Nthe power and automatically transmit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it throughout the ship what material\Ncould possibly Withstand that much
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power that's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right the gold i've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,harvested from this island works perfectly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And i'm sure it will\Nmake many inhabitants of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this island happy to\Nsee a flying ship before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their Demise the sight of this magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ship in flight will be\Nthe last thing they see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flying ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it really flies, I might not\Nhave a chance for escape after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the Ark Maxim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this ship, we will reach\Nthe land that knows no boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will travel to the endless birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground is made of stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:05:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo! Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these old buildings?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like this could be the place\Nthat huge golden bell is supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, could this be our homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that big hole come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you going this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could any of this have\Nhappened with you here? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wipe her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wipe her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka guy was really strong,\Nbut even he fell in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could possibly have done all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the only one who could\Ndo something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That god guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mantra didn't work at all the\Nwhole time we were in the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I don't know what happened here,\Nbut I do know it was Enel who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying Nami was taken\Naway from here by that god guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something,\NSkypiea, it'll disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My homeland will be completely gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said this nation in\Nthe sky was unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he'd send it\Ncrashing to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel is definitely going\Nafter the Golden Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't destroy this\Nplace until he's found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you must hurry because\Nthere isn't much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let Nami find\Nthat bell. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only two voices\Nleft on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be Nami and Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to take me to them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, Angel Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, Esau,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the arch-criminals Pagaya and his daughter\NConis, along with their accomplice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the former god Gonfall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are still on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone sees these fugitives, please\Nalert me, McKinley, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, report any news directly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of the great god Enel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we of the White Berets will defend the\Nsecurity of Skypiea with our very lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that Paggia's daughter's\Njust been seen in a harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heretic has entered\Nthrough gate number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd she come back when\Nshe knows she'll be caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture her at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it! Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain McLean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the criminal! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judgements will fall on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all that gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember your girlfriend\Nfrom Angel Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been listening, and it sounds like\Nshe's causing an uproar among the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be waiting on the going\NMary right now there's a great
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deal of noise outside at the moment but\Nno matter it's hardly worth mentioning
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mantra ability that all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem to possess can you use it\Nto locate a specific individual
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not usually most of us lack\Nthat ability however I can I am
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.87,0:12:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unique in addition to my\Nmantra, my lightning powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow me to pick up electrical\Nvibrations and overhear conversations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I hear someone say something,\Nshall we say out of line?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cast my judgment on them\Nthe range of my hearing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,extends over this entire\Nland so that's it it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suitable talent for a god\Nisn't it run as fast as you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can people of the sky This\Nis Skypiea's last dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.09,0:12:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A party of angels dancing in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you ever seen the look on a mortal's\Nface when he suddenly loses his footing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get away from here or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, even if I get away,\Nhe'll destroy the Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something\NI can do, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Get back! Stay away! Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from us, criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this island, you pestilence! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave now, or we'll all be\Ndestroyed when the judgment strikes you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a burn bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone you have to go\Nto cloud end at the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the clouds right away\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to escape to the\Nblue sea this land is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about to be destroyed\Nthere's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use every ship you can\Nfind and leave angel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,island at once what\Nkind of lunacy is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eneru's planning to destroy\Nthis land and everyone on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't evacuate\Nnow, we're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of trick is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nothing to be\Njoking about, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk that way about Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What's she doing\Nnow? Arrest her, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hear me i refuse to\Naccept that anaru is god
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be insane! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.55,0:16:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The judgment didn't come. But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after committing such sacrilege\Nagainst God, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because there's no longer any\Npoint in taking one life alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A member of the Divine Squad\Nescaped from Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He risked his life to\Ndeliver that message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died with my father when\NAniru cast judgment on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did God do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed\Nto take care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that lady mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the edge\Nof the clouds at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Cloud End!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just up and go like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all born and\Nraised here in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't live anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us have ever even\Nvisited the Blue Sea before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would we be able to live there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to stay here,\Ndoing nothing, waiting to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all known for the past six\Nyears what kind of a man Enel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he ever shown mercy, compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he says he's going to do\Nthis, then you know he will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a miracle will happen or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And our island will be spared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we know anything\Nabout Enel, we know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always had the power to bring us to\Ndespair, to make us suffer and break us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you, what happens now makes\Nour past suffering insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not going to do any good\Nsitting and waiting for a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to face the fact that\Nas far as this land is concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God has abandoned us\Nbefore we pray before we.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,close our eyes to what's\Nreally happening here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do what we\Ncan to save ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't survive by hiding\Nbehind his victims any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do nothing, no\Nmatter who we try to blame,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all going to lose our\Nlives, and it'll be our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if we want to live, we must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Miss, do you have any idea\Nwhat happened to the Divine Squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband is one of them and I\Ncan't leave the island without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my son's a member, is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only son is with him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:18:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divine Squad may already be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have they been doing all\Nthis time on the Upper Yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you the White Berets\Nwill look into this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will find your family members and\Nmake sure they're escorted safely to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain! Move along!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can guess what will\Nhappen to the Divine Squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inneru is that kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always known that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our priority is to make sure the citizens\Nare evacuated as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let this end like Birka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Byrdka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Eneru's homeland, a sky\Nisland far to the southeast of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told it disappeared\Nwithout a trace, some six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, six years ago? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel destroyed his own\Nhomeland, and then came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Byrdka was home to many strong warriors,\Nbut they were helpless before Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An invincible god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, maybe he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might already know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.39,0:20:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we White Berets\Nwere once in the Divine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squad pledged to the\Nservice of Lord Gonval.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought if we pretended\Nto betray the Divine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squad and swore our\Nallegiance to Lord Akainu,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could stay on the island and find\Nsome way to protect the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it's all too clear\Nthat plan was a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried to keep anyone from\Nprovoking Enoru's anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hoped that if no one\Ndisobeyed him, they'd be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else could we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, can I count on\Nyou to handle things here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but where are you going? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, there are some\Npeople who don't know how to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the Blue Sea Dwellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.45,0:21:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to move them all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've at least got to\Nreach the upper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, we must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is the right way! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hole on the left! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I thought, they weren't\Namong the five survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now where in the world\Ncould they have been hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.27,0:22:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.63,0:22:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How aggravating!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.03,0:22:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I hate more than\Nwhen my predictions turn out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the one they told him or Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you mess with friends of\Nmine, then you mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.61,0:23:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools were your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming up to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your tongue, mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're speaking to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you God anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's deliberately picking\Na fight with Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.61,0:23:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B-Wait, Luffy, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear it now, the angels party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.47,0:23:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The citizens must have\Nlearned of Skypiea's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how far they can run before\Nthe ground gives out beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.83,0:23:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, what makes you God anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see you are no\Nordinary human, but you're
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a mere paramecia type you can't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing that lives can stand\Nagainst me that's why I am gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.83,0:24:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.21,0:24:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.09,0:25:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you\Nmanaged to dodge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.21,0:25:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sixty million volts! He dodged it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charging!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.71,0:25:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred million volts!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.57,0:25:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Body!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if I thought\Nabout it, I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.03,0:25:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,realized it sooner\Nlightning can't hurt Loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.11,0:25:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made of rubber.\NI've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.73,0:26:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical attacks still\Ncan't affect my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a helpless monkey\Nfrom the Blue Sea World!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.85,0:26:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His electrical powers\Nare completely useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.93,0:26:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enteru must have never imagined there was
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.99,0:26:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone in the world who\Nis immune to lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.81,0:26:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible, but it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy may be the only person in\Nthe world who can battle Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're natural enemies!

